ist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-24T15:55:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T15:55:50Z","body":"> ZIP files created from folders in the FileSystem dock lack a top-level folder matching the original folder name. This mean it'll result in a zip-bomb if you extract the ZIP using 7-Zip's \"Extract here\" option\r\n\r\nMade the following changes:\r\n- Zips will now include the root fodler, this is also consistent with how **Project > Tools > Download Project Source** works on 4.7\r\n- Ziping a folder now includes the timestamp\r\n\r\n> I think the Project > Pack Project as ZIP option should be hidden in the web editor as it doesn't download the resulting ZIP. It's also funtionally identical to Download Project Source.\r\n\r\n- Hidden, could have reused the same button if i knew it existed (i never used it before), but i think the **Download Project Source** has better discoverability with the additional icon, along with not being grouped with \"export\" related actions","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5817535011/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5818946713","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123525#issuecomment-5818946713","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123525","id"